OL,3,AInterest rates hold expected but Bank
OL,4,Aof England facing tough choices
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolicymakers at the Bank of England are
OL,7,Fexpected to keep interest rates
OL,8,Funchanged despite price rises
OL,9,Faccelerating due to the prolonged
OL,10,Fconflict in the Middle East.
OL,12,FThe nine-member Monetary Policy
OL,13,FCommittee (MPC) has been meeting amid a
OL,14,Fbackdrop of increasing global energy
OL,15,Fprices and interest rate rises around
OL,16,Fthe world.
